<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan FGEP group to tender for 54,000T US corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan FGEP group to tender for 54,000T US corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group will tender on Thursday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. No.2 corn, local traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ever Smile Feed Mill Co and group newcomer Fong Yu.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			U.S. Gulf   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>   One    54,000  May 10-25   May 26-June 9</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
